 * @fn static dp_protocol_convert_status_t dp_protocol_convert_crash_announce_tiny_to_protobuf(const uint8_t *input, size_t input_size, uint8_t *output, size_t output_capacity, size_t *output_size)
 * @brief 将92字节旧崩溃公告展开为9个Protobuf字段。
